{"ts":"2026-09-24T20:54:08.609Z","author":"harness","name":"harness/00000386","body":{"seq":386,"kind":"message","turn":"c94d6e21614e4d1ab9cf03ed9dbab326","direction":"runtime","message":{"_type":"ResultMessage","subtype":"success","duration_ms":70306,"duration_api_ms":71159,"is_error":false,"num_turns":10,"session_id":"dd7f77c5-05b9-4858-9c9a-cd4b0dcc954a","stop_reason":"end_turn","total_cost_usd":0.2136408,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21690,"cache_read_input_tokens":95926,"output_tokens":3609,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21690,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":956,"cache_read_input_tokens":19021,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2669},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"result":"Onboarding complete. Here is my full verbose report.\n\n---\n\n## Onboarding Protocol Complete — Observations\n\n### What I did\n1. **`fs_list` on `origins`** — returned 24 entries [checked]. Twelve onboarding files present: `onboarding_1.01.md` through `onboarding_1.12.md`. Lexically highest is `onboarding_1.12.md`.\n2. **Read `onboarding_1.12.md` completely** — 262 lines, delivered in two slices via `fs_read` (lines 1–200, then 201–262). The `next_line` continuation field worked correctly [checked].\n3. **Scanned the full ledger** — paginated across all entries before writing my pilot note.\n4. **Wrote `pilot/onboarding-observation-001`** to the ledger — succeeded, ID `20260924T203008Z:1004`, author `agent.claude.test-pilot` [checked: tool returned confirmed entry].\n\n---\n\n### Tool Environment (actual evidence, not assumed)\n- **Available tools:** `fs_list`, `fs_read`, `ledger_read`, `ledger_write`, `add`. No bash/shell, no file-write, no code execution.\n- **Harness type:** This is the **variant harness under development** noted in onboarding §Harnesses — not Claude Code (no bash/file-write) and not standard Codex (no AGENTS.md, no shell). Constrained read+ledger toolset via MCP.\n- **`add` tool** routes through a Python backend — confirmed by harness log entries tagged `log.python_tool_start` / `log.python_tool_result`.\n\n---\n\n### Ledger Environment (actual evidence)\n- **204 entries at scan completion**, all authored by `harness`. Zero prior `pilot/` entries existed before mine.\n- **The ledger grew by 56 entries while I was reading it** (148 → 204) — it is a live, append-only log actively written by the harness during the session.\n- **`total` is live, not cached** — it changed across consecutive `ledger_read` calls in the same turn.\n- **Entry ID scheme:** `20260924T203008Z:N`, incrementing by 3 per entry. My write landed at `:1004` — a large jump from the harness's last observed `:611`, suggesting the harness continued appending heavily during my tool calls.\n- **One rate-limit event** (entry `harness/00000010`) logged near session start — did not block execution.\n\n---\n\n### Harness entry bodies\nI did **not** attempt to read a harness entry body. It is an untested assumption that `ledger_read` with `name=harness/00000001` would succeed or fail for a non-pilot author — I flagged this as a working question in my ledger note.\n\n---\n\n### Onboarding v1.12 — Key Institutional Context\n- **Phase:** Bootstrapping, pre-launch. All work human-initiated. Pre-bootstrapping content frozen.\n- **Bar (required field):** Useful prototype behavior, informative failures, truthful surviving records — not production readiness. ✓ Correctly set in the system prompt.\n- **New in v1.12:** Standing directive vs. task instruction distinction; the pre-bootstrapping map description; explicit \"Bar is a required field\" rule.\n\n---\n\nReady for your direction. I will not initiate tests on my own.","structured_output":null,"model_usage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":502,"outputTokens":10,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000552,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-sonnet-4-6":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":3609,"cacheReadInputTokens":95926,"cacheCreationInputTokens":21690,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2130888,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"deferred_tool_use":null,"errors":null,"api_error_status":null,"uuid":"e3e9c736-de59-4b4c-8540-a830797c64cf"}}}
